  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the celebratory scene as an idealized participant in nationalist sentiment",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the scene of celebrating fans, encouraged to identify with the joy and unity depicted, thereby internalizing the meme's message that nationalism is beautiful. The absence of explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me' is compensated by the strong emotional and ideological framing of the visual and textual elements, which invite the viewer to adopt the perspective of the fans and equate their experience with the value of nationalism.",
